  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "An idea that could potentially be an alternative for age verification or the Persona service, is having VRChat create a downloadable and printable form with minimal PII, which can be filled out, and taken to a notary public and have notarized.\n\nWhile this process is not instantaneous like Persona, it can offer more minimal and secure handling of identifiable information.\n\n(Please also offer these forms in different languages; thank you)",
